# Test Case pages generated by fhir-frog-testscript-render's TestScriptRenderCli
# (part of the "build" job's before_script - see .gitlab-ci.yml and test-cases.md) - one
# <TestScript.id>.md per TestScript under input/resources/, listed explicitly
# in sushi-config.yaml's pages: block but not committed, since they're a pure
# function of input/resources/ + fhir-frog's current main. Run the same CLI
# locally (see README.md's "Build" section) to preview them before pushing.
input/pagecontent/au-core-*.md
input/pagecontent/au-imagingresult.md
